OL,3,GNEWSAGuide dog helped me back to the
OL,4,Adancefloor after accident
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen Alan Barnes lost his sight in a
OL,7,F"freak accident", he thought his
OL,8,Fdancing days were over.
OL,10,FBut with the help of guide dog Windsor,
OL,11,Fthe 63-year-old has rediscovered his
OL,12,Flove for ceroc, a modern style of dance
OL,13,Fcombining elements of ballroom and
OL,14,Flatin.
OL,16,FAlan, from Southwell in
OL,17,FNottinghamshire, had impaired vision
OL,18,Fsince birth and lived most of his life
OL,19,Fwith sight in only one eye.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
